<title>USA: Brinker to open up to 69 new eateries in 98.</title>
<headline>Brinker to open up to 69 new eateries in 98.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brinker International said Thursday it plans to open 20-23 new Macaroni Grill restaurants in fiscal year 1998 and open 10 to 15 new Corner Bakery locations.</p>
<p>The company said it also is planning to open two or three new Maggiano's and 23 to 28 new On The Border Cafes, which will be in addition to the 17 new On The Border units opening in 1997.</p>
</text>
